        "suggestedProfitTake": "EN: Take partials into 5% to 8% intraday extensions because the name often retraces quickly once initial call buying cools.\n中文：若日内拉升5%到8%，可分批止盈，因为该股在首轮看涨买盘降温后经常快速回撤。",
